  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Appui au d&#xe9;veloppement du corridor Walvis Bay-Maputo - Namibie</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Boosting green and inclusive economic growth and integration along the corridor by developing and connecting selected trade hubs around ports 1. Improved transport and logistics systems that are more efficient, greener and safer in the Walvis Bay, L&#xfc;deritz port trade hubs along the corridor 2. Reduced costs of trade and increased trade performance in port trade hubs in Namibia 3. Improved planning and coordination for integrated corridor development in Namibia</narrative>
